Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:47.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,They say we are "cursed children,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,because at birth, we possess the\Ncursed power to control magical beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.67,0:02:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You worthless brats...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:06.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard that a long, long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.96,0:02:09.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,it was an ability\Nthat only controlled livestock,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.42,0:02:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,but then someone started using it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:15.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,to control monsters in war\Nand killed a lot of people,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,so we became loathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I told you not to look at me\Nwith those nasty eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:35.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We were hit, kicked...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.79,0:02:40.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Being sent flying by a kick\Nwas a daily occurrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:44.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:46.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,do you beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:50.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you when you can speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:58.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I asked a question once,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was beaten until\NI was almost unrecognizable,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:05.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,and I only got water\Nwith no food for three whole days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe because of the cursed power,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:17.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I happened to be able to read\Nthe minds of anyone in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So that thing is demon folk...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's one of them who killed Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:21.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's probably thinking of how to\Nexterminate us humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:21.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's one of them who killed Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:22.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's probably thinking of how to\Nexterminate us humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.92,0:03:24.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's probably thinking of how to\Nexterminate us humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.92,0:03:24.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:25.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It should have been that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:30.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,When they knew that\NI could read their minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:33.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,they got even more violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:36.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It can read minds? How frightening!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:37.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is why I hate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:38.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Useless wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:39.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:39.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Useless wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.04,0:03:39.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.04,0:03:39.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You filthy vermin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But no matter what\Nawful things happened to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never retaliated,\Nand I never even thought of doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:58.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even though I hated that I was loathed,\Nabused, and beaten,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:04:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never even wanted\Nto think about hurting anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:06.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,More than anything,\NI just didn't want to see any more blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.50,0:04:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.63,0:04:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can help a certain country\Nby taking these monsters with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.25,0:04:20.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Demon folk can be useful to people...\Nno, the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,What could bring you more pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can be useful to people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you simply do as I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,you will never be beaten\Nfor no reason again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:33.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will let you eat your fill\Nof delicious meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:36.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,And not just you, that goes\Nfor everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:37.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.46,0:04:42.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But if you turn it down,\Nyou'll get the same treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or rather, your days will be full\Nof even more pain than they are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because he wore a magical device\Non his forehead,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:53.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't read his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:59.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that man always kept his promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:01.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.13,0:05:10.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Since he promised me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.17,0:05:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to kill them...\NI have to kill them...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:14.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.79,0:05:24.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't control it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:34.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've messed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.79,0:05:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:40.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's going to suffer again\Nbecause of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.96,0:05:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But... now it can just kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I helped no one and nothing,\Nbut I didn't hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am happy to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I'm reborn, I hope I won't\Nget beaten so badly in my next life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:12.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope I can be at least\Na little bit useful to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:20.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I hope I can have something\Ndelicious to eat, at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.79,0:06:35.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:39.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is this person protecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.67,0:07:04.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? The bleeding stopped...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's good...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:50.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can make this work out after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.08,0:07:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dad. Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go gather\Nsome ingredients in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It all started a short while
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:06.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,after I returned from the training schools\Nin the royal capital, at dinner time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.67,0:08:09.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got a whole lot today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll dry these outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:15.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I'll pickle these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:16.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,And the rest...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.13,0:08:19.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll stick them in a soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:29.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if there was\Nsomething inedible in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:32.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought it would just give me\Na bit of a stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,But it was highly poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Low... Heal...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:05.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:08.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dragon's Ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:14.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mom told me never to eat this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:17.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I still have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Low Heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:37.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It doesn't hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I better?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:47.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dragon's Ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.29,0:09:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to be care-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:54.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,A Poison Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.63,0:09:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think... it also had...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:09:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was highly poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:05.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh... I feel all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.25,0:10:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I'm okay eating poison,\Nmaybe I can eat this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:21.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:23.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is incredibly delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.13,0:10:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The poison is spreading\Nslower than yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.75,0:10:32.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I gained some tolerance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.71,0:10:34.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,This might lead to me\Nacquiring a new skill!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.29,0:10:43.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,From then on I developed\Na taste for poisonous things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.96,0:10:47.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd collapse on occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,In the end I didn't acquire any skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I could eat poisonous things at the\Ncost of vomiting a small amount of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:11:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gosh, I can't believe\Npoisonous creatures are this yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a discovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:06.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that's probably why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,this thing is also delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.96,0:11:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:15.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,At first,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.33,0:11:18.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't counteract the poison in time,\Nso I spewed a little bit of blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:21.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I know from experience,\Nthat much is no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.00,0:11:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is the kid okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:26.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seems like the detoxification\Nof my Low Heal took effect in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:28.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:29.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.25,0:11:32.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:40.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,He can take on\Nsuch a horrible monster by himself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:11:55.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:12:01.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess this is the\Nfrog's all-or-nothing death strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.17,0:12:03.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.75,0:12:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This sure is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:37.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Strange that such a huge and\Ndangerous frog is outside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:41.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But even so, this poisonous of a frog\Nis probably pretty tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:43.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.21,0:12:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, he's not looking too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.63,0:12:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll have Lynne look him over later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:57.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That really was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:12:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you come here all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.67,0:13:02.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um... well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:06.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who brought that thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-because I promised...\Nto bring it to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:13.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,To the city? He promised?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:17.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,He went through all that trouble\Nto bring that poison frog there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:18.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,He can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:20.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That HAS to be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.58,0:13:23.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That frog...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:25.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,must've been for eating, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:28.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're trying to deliver\Nthat much fresh meat,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,getting it there while alive\Nis the best way to do it, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:35.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I understand he had\Nto use seal to hide himself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:38.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,to be safe and not get robbed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,and it's not surprising that a large city
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:44.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,would also have the techniques\Nto manage that poison properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.13,0:13:49.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe this kid even put in a lot of work\Nto raise this frog the best he could...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, grow up strong and healthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.04,0:13:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good boy, good boy, good boy!\NSuch a good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:59.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I ruined the delivery\Nof his precious stock to the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.13,0:14:03.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I did this\Nto your valuable food supply!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.04,0:14:05.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:08.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't have much money, though,\Nso it'll take me some time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.33,0:14:12.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't have to pay me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.75,0:14:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:15.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's really okay, don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?\NIt's in so many pieces now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, how did you bring\Nthat ferocious creature this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.25,0:14:33.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no way\Nyou could have dragged it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.25,0:14:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I can control monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:39.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I used that to bring it all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:41.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what do you mean\Nyou can control monsters?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.25,0:14:48.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,This tiny kid can control\Nthat enormous monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.13,0:14:50.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What an amazing skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:53.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are there others in the world\Nthat can do that sort of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:55.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:57.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it not one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.58,0:15:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was born with it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's that sort of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:05.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-born with it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:08.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Being able to do that\Nfrom the day you were born...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:10.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:14.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Something like that can only be\Na talent gifted from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.25,0:15:16.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,U-um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.88,0:15:18.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm de-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:22.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,demon folk, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:23.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Demon folk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:25.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:29.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,All demon folk can do that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.42,0:15:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, so basically demon folk\Nare a tribe who all have that ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.17,0:15:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,and it's nothing special, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.42,0:15:37.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:42.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've imagined so many times\Nabout what I'd do if I had that ability...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:46.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd have animals help\Nwork the fields and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:51.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I can use birds, it'd be nice\Nto have them deliver letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.00,0:15:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even at night, I wouldn't worry about\Ngetting attacked by stray dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:58.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's seriously impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:16:04.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,U-um, you aren't afraid of me\Nbeing demon folk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.79,0:16:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't... hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:08.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are people who are scared of,\Nand also hate that I have, this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:17.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who would hate a power like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't think it's something you\Nshould pay much mind to, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:24.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,They can say what they want,\Nbut that's a super useful ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:32.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's how great of a skill it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:37.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish I could take it off your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:49.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.33,0:16:57.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,like me really be needed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:05.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Unlike me, he was blessed\Nwith a desirable ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.17,0:17:08.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,so why does he have so little self-worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.67,0:17:12.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's probably focused\Non other things right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:14.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure this kid will go places.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.21,0:17:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.63,0:17:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Way more than they'd need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hordes of them would,\Nif that's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:30.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.29,0:17:33.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.67,0:17:35.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, completely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:37.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I must treat you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm really okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:40.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not even bleeding anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:43.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not to brag,\Nbut I'm strong against poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:49.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That wasn't just deadly poison...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.33,0:17:52.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was a miasma, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,An extreme poison\Nthat even ruins the soil in its path.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.79,0:17:59.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Taking that direct attack and then\Ncarrying on as if nothing has happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.67,0:18:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, there's one possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:05.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Sacred Spirit."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.67,0:18:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Sain the Sovereign of Salvation\Nonce showed it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.79,0:18:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,By honing the body and mind\Nlike a saint,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.33,0:18:15.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,the technique purifies\Neverything it touches
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,and heals all wounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It is the perfection he finally found\Nat the end of his unconventional training.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It took Instructor Sain 40 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,but Instructor Noor achieved it\Nwhile still so young?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Lynne,\Nplease tend to this kid first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:36.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't need help either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.46,0:18:40.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pale skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:43.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hair of silver mixed with light blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:47.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dark eyes that seem like they'll\Npull you into their depths...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:51.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you a demon folk child?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:54.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, demon folk.\NYou know your stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:57.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even knowing this,\NInstructor, will this child-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:19:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, what do you intend to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:03.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I can, I want to take him\Nin the carriage...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:05.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor, you can't-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,They are a dangerous race which\Nmany countries recommended killing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you really okay with that, Instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.63,0:19:18.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,This child is demon folk, and the monster\Nit brought along caused this situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It sure is unfortunate that\Nthe wheat field got messed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.88,0:19:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,but he can't finish his job with\Nthe poison frog because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:28.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,By "poison frog" do you mean\Nthat Black Death Dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.58,0:19:30.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You were bringing a\NBlack Death Dragon to the city?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:33.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is far too dangerous,\Nlike I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:34.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if he is just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.08,0:19:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you said you promised to do all that,\Nbut who asked you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.21,0:19:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Concealing the truth will do you no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:50.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It would be a huge help\Nif you told us the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.13,0:19:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:57.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was raised this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.25,0:20:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,The frightened demeanor\Nand look in his eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.71,0:20:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's clear as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.17,0:20:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,This child is a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:07.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Slaves are outlawed in the Clays Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:09.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,but that isn't the case\Nin other countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,In all likelihood, he's a child soldier\Nwhose status is being taken advantage of.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you have a home to go back to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.67,0:20:19.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, I was blindfolded part\Nof the way here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:23.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,and I don't know where\Nthe city I was in might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:26.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then what do you think about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:30.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd like to give you\Na ride to the nearest city.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What was I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:42.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,My father often warned me not to be misled\Nby rumors and trust my own eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.83,0:20:48.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I only saw a boy from\Na "wicked race" that scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.88,0:20:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't see him as a malnourished child\Nwith nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:58.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so ashamed of myself\Nfor being small-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:03.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rolo, huh? Great name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.50,0:21:07.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Short and easy to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.79,0:21:08.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I also have a favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.21,0:21:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can we take this child, Rolo, with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.71,0:21:16.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Lynneburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:17.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:21.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,If there's no room for him,\Nhe can have my spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.29,0:21:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That isn't the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:26.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Demon folk are not allowed entry\Ninto the Holy Theocracy of Mithra,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.46,0:21:28.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,which is our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.38,0:21:31.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It may be difficult to bring him with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Likewise, even if we leave him\Non the way there,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:37.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,it would be difficult\Nfor this boy to survive alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.71,0:21:41.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we bring him with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.38,0:21:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,we may be considered\Nenemies of Mithra and attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:47.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even so, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.17,0:21:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:22:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh, I thought it'd be\Nlong dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.00,0:22:10.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,#6 I Parry Deadly Poison
